{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>What's she talking about? <STYLE ID="1">This girl</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A joke... right...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As a joke, it's far too cruel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That goddess-like <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE>... and this <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> is going to kill her...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haha, it has to be a joke after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does she want to hear my story that badly?<PG>
But <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> just kept looking straight at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's she playing at? Does she think she can coax my secret out of me with a joke like that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's still a middle schooler, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still... a child...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学近い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'm going to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> soon."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> gazed at me steadily with those odd eyes of hers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Is that so... Did you have a </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="けんか">fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> or something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered with an attitude that plainly said, 'That's a joke, right?'<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, it's not that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't want to kill her, so I'm leaving here before that happens."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't quite follow what she meant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then just don't kill her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'd like to, but I just can't stop it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Probably..."</STYLE><PG>
What on earth is the setup of this fantasy?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A middle schooler might well get lost in that kind of setup, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I should dig a little deeper.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why would you kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">? What do you mean, you can't stop it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Please, look at my eyes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Your eyes...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\オッドアイ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Needless to say, odd eyes, blue and green.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That alone is material enough for fantasizing that you're someone special.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Has she let it get pretty far <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="こじ">out of hand</STYLE>...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"These eyes are cursed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I-is that so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ah, she's let it get completely <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="こじ">out of hand</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first I thought she was a polite, good girl, but she's at that age after all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">you know about the Megasawa City case, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that instant, the air around me froze.
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The case at the root of my decision to take this revenge. There's no way I wouldn't know it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course I know it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I thought so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">These eyes and the Megasawa City case are deeply connected."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The air around me, which I'd thought was frozen, thawed a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, so she's trying to tie her setup to that violent crime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Makes sense, makes sense...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Make it make sense, me...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">My big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I told you about her, right? She's studying abroad right now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">My big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't like me. Both her eyes are blue. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had blue and green eyes too when she was born, the same as me, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The talk was starting to take a slightly different turn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Human eye color doesn't change that easily.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The moment the first Megasawa City case was over... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">my big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> ended up with both eyes blue, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that moment, I was certain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\竹林黒霧.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
What <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> was saying was no fantasy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She truly believed she would end up killing <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The causal link was unclear, but at the very least, an incident that gave her grounds had occurred around the time of the Megasawa City case.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Back then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wanted to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, wanted to kill her so badly she couldn't bear it, apparently. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It hurt as if something were keeping her from breathing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, she wanted to kill her, wanted to kill her... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was shut away under here for a little while, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Under here...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, there must be a cellar or something under this rush mat.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So I'm leaving here before I start wanting to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't know why that happened to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but I think it's connected to the Megasawa City case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No matter how long I wait, the color of my eyes doesn't change. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Until the color of these eyes changes, I won't see </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But you've been fine up to now, haven't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Then..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told me that too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I ever suddenly want to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I should tell him right away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">He said he'd help me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, help her...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All the causes and effects are too tangled together for me to follow, but <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE> must know something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I find that out, I'll have a clue for helping <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>...<PG>
No, what am I thinking!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I came here to destroy this settlement, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> along with it!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't owe her any help in the first place!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Stop growing! My <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="りょうしん">tumor</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Please... stop...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you must have something troubling you too, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">My aunt</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you know about her, so what did you come here to do, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　On the train, you looked sad the whole time... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I thought maybe I could at least listen to you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And also..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> looked over at my bag.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, there's been a smell coming from your bag this whole time, the smell of gunpowder. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Is there a gun in there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She can tell by the smell...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't smell anything at all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I hunt in the mountains a lot, so I know the smell of the hunting rifles the grown-ups use very well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, please tell me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll help you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I... nothing..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Someone from Motoki-cho comes to the Arata settlement carrying a gun. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To the Arata settlement, with its deep causal ties to that Megasawa City case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I can tell that much is no small thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I told you, nothing..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I understand you can't trust me when we only met today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you've looked sad this whole time. </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I want to help you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I want to make things even a little easier for you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Gazing steadily into my eyes, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s blue and green eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not eyes that <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="にら">glared</STYLE>, but eyes that gazed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A gaze with no sharpness, one that seemed to softly stroke my cheek.<PG>
When I looked into those eyes―
{PAUSE ""}
when she looked back at me―
{PAUSE ""}
it felt as if I could be very much at ease.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Under that gaze, the strength slowly drained out of me as well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I told you about my plan to leave at 15. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You promised not to tell that secret, so I won't tell anyone your secret either, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I can't casually ask you to trust me, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I want to help you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that I want you to trust me. I want to help."</STYLE><PG>
The gun, <STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>, Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By now <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> had seen through almost all of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if there were any point in hiding it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If, truly―
{PAUSE ""}
if by telling <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> I could truly be saved―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I had... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">a little sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">A really smart, cute </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">little sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without my meaning to, those words came out of my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I wasn't surprised by it, either.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
No, there was one thing that surprised me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I said it out loud, I felt the ugly lump in my heart melt a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I say it, I can feel better.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> will―help me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Please help me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> silently came close beside me and stroked my back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So very comforting, that palm of <STYLE ID="1">hers</STYLE>.<PG>
Doubts about whether to trust her or not had disappeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want her to help me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, help me...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
