{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I confessed everything about how I'd come here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The case in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How things were between us sisters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That I'd wanted us to be closer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ゆが">twisted</STYLE> my heart was.<PG>
For the first time, I said my plan out loud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I cried as I confessed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not because I regretted what I'd done.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because hearing that confession myself, I found it far too empty.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Erina-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... was it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's a cute name."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Confessing while a middle schooler took pains to spare my feelings, I was utterly pathetic.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> didn't get angry even when she heard my plan. Apart from a word here and there to show she was following, she listened in silence.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you've been through something really painful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> or my parents died, it would be painful for me too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> must have thought about her family dying many times too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why she isn't surprised, even hearing my story.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
