<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, thank you for trusting me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll keep this in my heart and nowhere else."</STYLE>
